        {
          "text": "Beria kodi Sema oyido jobedo jotel ma pecin ma jogeto i tindi madwoŋ Ayijalon aka joriemo ji m'oyido jobedo i tindi madwoŋ Gath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
